USS (Universal Source Separation) — MLX Swift port
==================================================

This directory is a Swift/MLX port of ByteDance's Universal Source
Separation model.

Upstream project: https://github.com/bytedance/uss
Upstream licence: Apache License, Version 2.0

    Copyright 2023 ByteDance

Upstream ships the Apache-2.0 short-form notice rather than the full
licence text, which is why GitHub's licence detector reports the repo as
"Other" rather than Apache-2.0.

